  "description": "The owner of an online fashion store, Jin Yoon's the total package. She's got beauty, brains, money, and even fame. But due having her heart broken in the past, she no longer believes in love. But one day, she meets Suho and her heart melts. They soon get married, but Yoonjin realizes her marriage wasn't all it was cut out to be.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/53879878), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/mysh_001), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/4421000450), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/my_husbands_stalker), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5274115), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000053974)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.ono.live/webtoon/my-husband-s-stalker)",
